#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:42
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Util-linux"
msgstr "Instalação do Util-linux"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The FHS recommends using the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/lib/hwclock</filename> directory instead of the "
"usual <filename class=\"directory\">/etc</filename> directory as the "
"location for the <filename>adjtime</filename> file. Create this directory "
"with:"
msgstr ""
"O FHS recomenda usar o diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/lib/hwclock</filename> em vez do usual diretório "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/etc</filename> como o local para o arquivo "
"<filename>adjtime</filename>. Crie esse diretório com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:50
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -pv /var/lib/hwclock</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -pv /var/lib/hwclock</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:52
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Util-linux for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare o Util-linux para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:54
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --libdir=/usr/lib     \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run    \\\n"
"            --disable-chfn-chsh   \\\n"
"            --disable-login       \\\n"
"            --disable-nologin     \\\n"
"            --disable-su          \\\n"
"            --disable-setpriv     \\\n"
"            --disable-runuser     \\\n"
"            --disable-pylibmount  \\\n"
"            --disable-static      \\\n"
"            --disable-liblastlog2 \\\n"
"            --without-python      \\\n"
"            ADJTIME_PATH=/var/lib/hwclock/adjtime \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/util-linux-&util-linux-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --libdir=/usr/lib     \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run    \\\n"
"            --disable-chfn-chsh   \\\n"
"            --disable-login       \\\n"
"            --disable-nologin     \\\n"
"            --disable-su          \\\n"
"            --disable-setpriv     \\\n"
"            --disable-runuser     \\\n"
"            --disable-pylibmount  \\\n"
"            --disable-static      \\\n"
"            --disable-liblastlog2 \\\n"
"            --without-python      \\\n"
"            ADJTIME_PATH=/var/lib/hwclock/adjtime \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/util-linux-&util-linux-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:70
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das opções do configure:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:73
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>ADJTIME_PATH=/var/lib/hwclock/adjtime</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>ADJTIME_PATH=/var/lib/hwclock/adjtime</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:75
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This sets the location of the file recording information about the hardware "
"clock in accordance to the FHS. This is not strictly needed for this "
"temporary tool, but it prevents creating a file at another location, which "
"would not be overwritten or removed when building the final util-linux "
"package."
msgstr ""
"Isso configura o local do arquivo gravando informação acerca do relógio de "
"hardware de acordo com o FHS. Isso não é estritamente necessário para essa "
"ferramenta temporária, porém impede a criação de um arquivo em outro local, "
"o qual não seria sobrescrito ou removido quando da construção do pacote "
"util-linux final."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--libdir=/usr/lib</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--libdir=/usr/lib</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:86
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This switch ensures the <filename class=\"extension\">.so</filename> "
"symlinks targeting the shared library file in the same directory (<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/lib</filename>) directly."
msgstr ""
"Essa chave assegura que os links simbólicos <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.so</filename> apontem para o arquivo de biblioteca "
"compartilhada no mesmo diretório (<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/lib</filename>) diretamente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--disable-*</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--disable-*</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"These switches prevent warnings about building components that require "
"packages not in LFS or not installed yet."
msgstr ""
"Essas chaves evitam avisos acerca de componentes de construção que exigem "
"pacotes que não estão no LFS ou ainda não estão instalados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--without-python</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--without-python</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This switch disables using <application>Python</application>.  It avoids "
"trying to build unneeded bindings."
msgstr ""
"Essa chave desabilita o uso do <application>Python</application>. Ela evita "
"tentar construir ligações desnecessárias."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>runstatedir=/run</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>runstatedir=/run</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/util-linux.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This switch sets the location of the socket used by <command>uuidd</command>"
" and <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libuuid</filename> correctly."
msgstr ""
"Essa chave configura corretamente o local do soquete usado por "
"<command>uuidd</command> e <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libuuid</filename>."

